Forwarded: https://github.com/libuv/libuv/issues/5303
Last-Update: 2026-09-27
Author: Jérémy Lal <kapouer@melix.org>
--- a/test/test-sizeof.c
+++ b/test/test-sizeof.c
@@ -878,9 +878,9 @@
